 with still pictures.","Film: {title}","Close the film","notReady","The film of this story is coming soon. It is not made yet.","error","The film did not load.","captionsNote","Captions are in the language of the voice.",{"_214":215,"_216":217,"_218":219,"_220":221,"_150":222,"_223":224,"_225":226,"_227":228,"_229":230,"_231":232,"_233":234,"_235":236,"_237":238,"_239":240,"_241":242,"_243":243,"_244":244,"_245":245,"_183":183,"_246":246,"_247":247,"_248":249,"_250":251,"_252":253,"_254":255},"play","Play","pause","Pause","enableCaptions","Turn captions on","disableCaptions","Turn captions off","Captions","enterFullscreen","Full screen","exitFullscreen","Leave full screen","mute","Sound off","unmute","Sound on","seek","Position in the film","videoPlayer","Film player","playbackTime","Time","loading","Loading","timeOf","{currentTime} of {totalTime}","remaining","{time} left","hour","hours","minute","second","seconds","networkError","The connection failed.","decodeError","The film could not be played.","notSupported","This film cannot play on this device.","notLoaded","Film not loaded yet.","bookLabel","Book: {title}. Drag a page corner, or use the arrow keys.","Close the book","textSize","Text size","smaller","Smaller text","larger","Larger text","pageOf","Page {n} of {total}","prevPage","Previous page","nextPage","Next page","listen","Listen","Turn pages by itself","autoFlipHint","When the voice finishes a page","on","On","off","Off","theEnd","The end","readAgain","Read again","tapToListen","Tap Listen to start the voice.","Opening the book…","pageError","A picture did not load.","audioError","The recording did not play.","noRecordingPage","No recording for this page yet.","accessEndedTitle","Your access has ended","accessEndedLead","This book is closed for now. Profiles and progress are kept.","devVoice","Browser voice (development only, not the real voice)","testRecording","Test recording","What would you like to do?","read","Read","readHint","Turn the pages","listenHint","Read along with the voice","watch","Watch","watchHint","The film of the story","do","Do","doHint","An activity together","Test recording: soft ticks, not a voice yet","noRecording","Voice coming soon","noFilm","Film coming soon","noActivity","This story has no activity.","hintTitle","Four ways into every story","hintLead","Read it, listen to it, watch its film, or do its activity. All four are always here.","hintDismiss","Got it","storyCredit","A StoryTime story","authorCredit","The author's own story","lockedTitle","This book is locked","lockedLead","It opens with a pass for its age group. Profiles and progress are always kept.","backToLibrary","Back to the library","progressRead","Read up to page {n}","progressWatched","Film watched","progressDone","Activity done","picture","Placeholder: this picture is not drawn yet","cover","No cover yet","whoIsReading","Who is reading?","whoIsReadingLead","Choose a profile. Each one keeps its own place in every book.","reading","Reading: {name}","changeReader","Change","groupLegend","continueTitle","Continue where you left off","continuePage","Page {n}","continueAction","Continue","nothingStarted","Nothing started yet. Choose a book on the shelf.","shelfLabel","Bookshelf","viewLegend","Show the books as","viewShelf","Shelf","viewList","List","prevBook","Previous book","nextBook","Next book","openBook","Open this book","bookOf","Book {n} of {total}","lockedBy","Opens with a pass for {group}","emptyGroup","No stories in this age group yet.","samplesNote","Books marked \"Sample\" are test books for building the site. The real stories will replace them.","myShelf","My shelf","myShelfEmpty","No favourites yet. Tap the heart on a book to keep it here.","addFavourite","Add to my shelf","removeFavourite","Remove from my shelf","trialOpened","{n} of {total} trial stories opened","groups",{"_608":614,"_610":615,"_612":616},"groupHints",{"_608":609,"_610":611,"_612":613},"months",{"_602":603,"_604":605,"_606":607},"plans",{"_454