elf comes in the next step.","interimStory","Simple view for now: the storybook page comes in the next step.","page","activePass","{group} pass, until {date}","keptNote","Profiles and progress are always kept.","Cancel a purchase","lead","You may cancel a pass within 14 days of buying it, or of receiving the purchase confirmation if that came later.","refund","The refund is made within 14 days of your request. A cancellation fee of at most 5% of the price or 100 shekels, whichever is lower, may be kept.","Access to that pass ends when you cancel. Profiles and progress stay.","trialNote","The free trial needs no cancelling: nothing is charged, and it never turns into a payment.","noRenew","Passes never renew, so there is nothing to stop.","signedInTitle","Your passes","signedInNone","No pass can be cancelled right now.","confirmTitle","Cancel this purchase?","confirmLead","{group}, {length}. Access ends now. The refund is made within 14 days.","confirm","Yes, cancel the purchase","keep","Keep the pass","Purchase cancelled. Access to this pass has ended and your refund request is recorded. A confirmation is on its way by email.","signedOutTitle","Not signed in?","signedOutLead","Sign in to cancel in one step, or send this form.","email","Email used for the purchase","orderRef","Order number (in the purchase confirmation)","message","Message","send","Send the cancellation request","sent","Your request is recorded. We confirm it by email.","otherWays","Other ways to cancel","contactPlaceholder","Email address and postal address for cancelling: to be added before sales open.","homeLink","homeMethods","Online on that page, by email or by post. Details are on the page.","Check your pass","testBadge","Test checkout: no money is taken.","passLabel","Pass","groupLabel","lengthLabel","Length","startsLabel","Starts","endsLabel","Ends","totalLabel","Total, including VAT","queuedNote","You already have a pass for this group, so this one starts when it ends.","termsCheck","I agree to the Terms of use","rightsLink","Your right to cancel","pay","Continue to payment","processing","Processing. Please keep this page open.","confirming","We are confirming your payment with the payment company…","successTitle","Your pass is active","successLead","{group}, until {date}. A confirmation is on its way to your email.","successQueued","{group}: it starts on {start}, when your current pass ends, and runs until {date}.","failedTitle","The payment did not go through","failedLead","Nothing was charged. You can try again.","cancelledTitle","Payment cancelled","cancelledLead","Nothing was charged.","tryAgain","Try again","toLibrary","Go to the library","toPasses","See my passes","Order number","testPayTitle","Test payment page","testPayLead","This page stands in for the payment company’s page until it is connected. No card is asked for and nothing is charged.","testPaySucceed","Pay (test)","testPayFail","Make the payment fail (test)","testPayCancel","Cancel and go back","amount","Amount","signInFirst","Sign in or create an account to buy a pass.","One pass per age group. A pass opens every story of its group, with everything in it.","placeholderBadge","Placeholder","priceNotSet","Price not set yet","vatIncluded","Price in shekels, including VAT","perMonth","Per month: {price}","total","Total: {price}","paidOnce","Paid once. Does not renew.","choose","Choose {length}","allFeatures","Every pass has every feature. The only difference is how long it lasts.","factsTitle","Before you buy","factInstant","Access starts online right after payment.","factEnds","A pass ends on its end date. We email you before it ends.","factTwoGroups","One account can hold passes for two age groups.","factQueue","A pass bought while another for the same group is running starts when that one ends.","factCancel","You may cancel within 14 days of buying. The refund comes within 14 days; a fee of at most 5% of the price or 100 shekels, whichever is lower, may apply.","factValidity","Prices 